# What the first commands after the prompt read in the debian image (the
# warm set: KW_WARM_SCRIPT in its build.sh), past the boot set: these
# files follow boot-files in debian.erofs, and the SDK fetches them in the
# background once the boot is done (guest/lib/image.sh). Recorded by
# KW_DISTRO_TRACE=1 guest/build.sh distro debian; do not edit by hand.
